          "verified_by": [
            "harness-tests",
            "dependency-policy"
          ],
          "requirement_clauses": [],
          "knowledge_claims": []
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-2",
          "statement": "CI 在冻结 Android commit/tree 和无产品源码漂移前提下启动专用 emulator；网络安装只发生在显式 SDK/Gradle prewarm 阶段，实际 Oracle Orchestrator 仍以 --offline 构建并只访问 SourceLab loopback。Android Runner、SourceLab scenario、canonicalizer 与输入 digest 全部进入 evidence/proposal bindings。",
